  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Plotting the diagram of the given data we get,</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/e00ce334-c408-40ac-81bc-c59d73a43ac0.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 163px;\"/></p><p>We know that diagonals of a parallelogram bisect each other.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mtext>Mid-point of</mtext><mo> </mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>Mid-point of</mtext><mo> </mo><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>+</mo><mo> </mo><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p>",
